# Priestess — an Aggro enemy of the 1997 game, the deck as the original shipped it.
# tier: 2/12 Aggro enemies — 12 life, bribe 40 gold
# enemy: Priestess (1997 in-game name, s30/assets/text/Advstrings.txt @CREATURENAMES)
# designer: Coyote Tex, MicroProse designer/producer — every enemy deck (precon page, ref. 2)
# variant: Original (base game; the enemy deck files are dated 19 September 1996)
# source: ../shandalar-src/Decks.zip:Decks/0204.dck "Priestess (W, 4th)" [Tier 3 — Manalink 3
#   file dated 2016-02-15; its first 15 maindeck lines are the 1997 deck, the 13 lines (60
#   cards) after them are the modern deck Manalink appended and are NOT shipped; its
#   .vNone/.v<Colour> sections are the 1997 colour-keyed swaps]
# source: ../s30/assets/configs/rogues/priestess.toml (main_cards, sideboard_cards, level 2)
#   [Tier 3 — equals the 1997 prefix above]
# source: ../mage-go/rogue_dck/priestess.dck [Tier 3 — equals the 1997 prefix]
# cross-check: https://mtg.wiki/page/Shandalar_Enemy_Decks_(Aggro) — "Priestess" (Original)
#   [Tier-web — maindeck agrees]
# group: 1997 originals
name: Priestess
23 Plains
4 Animate Wall
2 Reverse Damage
3 Healing Salve
3 Ivory Cup
4 Wall of Swords
4 Wall of Spears
3 Spirit Link
2 Pikemen
2 Fortified Area
2 Benalish Hero
2 Blessing
2 Mesa Pegasus
2 Castle
2 Elder Land Wurm
2 Swords to Plowshares
1 Disenchant
# The 1997 file's colour-keyed sideboard sections. The AI played the maindeck WITHOUT
# .vNone plus the one section matching the player's deck colour (.vNone by default);
# .vNone is folded into the maindeck above, and SB: holds, per name, the largest
# colour-section count minus the .vNone count — the smallest sideboard from which
# every 1997 configuration can be rebuilt by swapping.
#   .vNone   2 Swords to Plowshares, 1 Disenchant
#   .vBlack  1 Circle of Protection: Black, 1 Disenchant, 1 Swords to Plowshares
#   .vBlue   1 Circle of Protection: Blue, 1 Disenchant, 1 Swords to Plowshares
#   .vGreen  1 Circle of Protection: Green, 1 Disenchant, 1 Swords to Plowshares
#   .vRed    1 Circle of Protection: Red, 1 Disenchant, 1 Swords to Plowshares
#   .vWhite  1 Circle of Protection: White, 1 Disenchant, 1 Swords to Plowshares
SB: 1 Circle of Protection: Black
SB: 1 Circle of Protection: Blue
SB: 1 Circle of Protection: Green
SB: 1 Circle of Protection: Red
SB: 1 Circle of Protection: White
